{"updated": "2026-08-21T08:56:03.016266+00:00", "fetched": 7, "cache_hits": 3, "bundles": {"4155afa4cdd6": {"label": "cross-asset \u00b7 4 series \u2191", "level": "red", "score": 11.47, "members": ["dyn_mrna", "btc_usd", "eth_usd", "dyn_coin"], "articles": [{"title": "Crude oil price falls in futures trade on weak global cues", "feed": "BusinessLine Mkts", "ts": "2026-08-21T07:39:39+00:00", "url": "https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/markets/commodities/crude-oil-price-falls-in-futures-trade-on-weak-global-cues/article71372686.ece", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "Analysts said the prices fell after participants offloaded their holdings amid weak demand in the spot market.\n\nCrude oil prices fell by \u20b918 to \u20b98,286 per barrel in the futures trade on Friday amid weak global trends.\n\nOn the Multi Commodity Exchange, crude oil futures for September delivery slipped by \u20b918, or 0.22 per cent, to \u20b98,286 per barrel in a business turnover of 3,477 lots.\n\nAnalysts said the prices fell after participants offloaded their holdings amid weak demand in the spot market.\n\nGlobally, West Texas Intermediate crude was trading 0.58 per cent lower at $86.33 per barrel, while Brent crude declined 0.35 per cent to $93.45 per barrel in New York.\n\nComments have to be in English,", "citation": "Crude oil price falls in futures trade on weak global cues \u2014 BusinessLine Mkts, 2026-08-21. https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/markets/commodities/crude-oil-price-falls-in-futures-trade-on-weak-global-cues/article71372686.ece"}, {"title": "Nifty\u2019s higher highs offer a bullish signal amid global turmoil", "feed": "Mint Markets", "ts": "2026-08-21T06:57:46+00:00", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/market/stock-market-news/niftys-higher-highs-offer-a-bullish-signal-amid-global-turmoil-11787283025704.html", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "This is a Mint Premium article gifted to you.Subscribe to enjoy similar stories.\n\nThe Nifty 50 is showing signs of a sturdier recovery 